WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.767
Month-end billing: monthly accounts and maintenance.

00:00:04.467 --> 00:00:16.100
Month-end run. Customers set to 'Invoicing: Monthly' get their completed jobs billed at month end. This bar lists them with the total. No bar = nothing to bill.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:27.467
Create the drafts. Create … invoices asks first, then makes one draft per job. They land on the Drafts tab to check before sending. The tour doesn't press it.

00:00:27.967 --> 00:00:36.733
Maintenance to bill. Finished maintenance visits and monthly fees waiting to be billed, with how many customers and the amount before tax.

00:00:37.233 --> 00:00:47.500
Create the invoices. Makes one draft per customer straight away, a line per visit or monthly fee. They land on Drafts too. The tour doesn't press it.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.767
Check the drafts. Every new month-end invoice waits here as a draft.

00:00:53.267 --> 00:01:02.067
Open, check, send. Open each draft, check the lines, then Email now or Print now. That marks it sent and it moves to Open.

00:01:02.567 --> 00:01:08.167
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
